ts:","value":"1888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-12-10T09:47:04-08:00","id":1470150,"title":"","content":"The book looks FANTASTIC thanks to Grumpy RPG Reviews.<br /> <br /> It may or may not be terrible in the writing (that is on me after all) but this is professional quality layout work. His art pics are amazing too.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-01-15T14:52:49-08:00","id":1472517,"title":"","content":"I've been working hard on my most recent ST Vault supplement, and I decided to try and rework the ANARCHS book, as while I enjoyed it, I didn't find it particularly useful - as either a player or ST. With that in mind, I've put together as much content as I could think of that would be relevant for an aspiring anarch, from the perspective of the clans, varying systems of governance, anarchs around the world, and the types of people that end up anarch - each with an eye for hooks and inspiration. If you've an interest in the sect, then check it out:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/m/product/383388\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/m/img/stvault/m_icon_menu_cab.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/m/product/383388\" target=\"_blank\"> Storytellers Vault </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/m/product/383388\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.storytellersvault.com/m/product/383388 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> wot pdf, nwod pdf, download wod, white wolf, ww, wod, nwod, vtm, mta, mage the ascension, world of darkness, drivethru, rpg, roleplaying, role-playing, role playing, tabletop, rules, adventure, Changeling, Werewolf, Recoking, Masquerade, vtm, Vampire, pdf </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24788-chipotlechris","name":"chipotlechris","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24788_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"99"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-01-16T08:01:15-08:00","id":1472571,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>chipotlechris</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1462396-storytellers-vault-is-opening-to-vampire-the-masquerade-5th-edition?p=1472517#post1472517\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I've been working hard on my most recent ST Vault supplement, and I decided to try and rework the ANARCHS book, as while I enjoyed it, I didn't find it particularly useful - as either a player or ST. With that in mind, I've put together as much content as I could think of that would be relevant for an aspiring anarch, from the perspective of the clans, varying systems of governance, anarchs around the world, and the types of people that end up anarch - each with an eye for hooks and inspiration. If you've an interest in the sect, then check it out:<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/m/product/383388\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.storytellersvault.com/m/product/383388</a></div> </div> </div> </div>Sounds awesome, friend!<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-