35982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-02-10T05:02:37-08:00","id":1474366,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Manfr</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1462396-storytellers-vault-is-opening-to-vampire-the-masquerade-5th-edition?p=1474357#post1474357\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> The WOD leader is Justin Achilli, who is far from being a &quot;juvenile&quot; author or someone concerned with his own &quot;fanon LARP&quot;. Along with our favourite uberWOD Nerd Matthew Dawkins, he is probably the most knowledgeable WOD loremaster out there.<br /> <br /> Mind you, Martin Ericsson and his team, who were accused of being juvenile fanon LARPers, were very keen on using A LOT of references to earlier canon in the first V5 products, which are much more nuanced in latest OPP and ParaWolf products.<br /> <br /> As much as one cannot agree with their artistic vision, I wouldn't say that the IP is managed by people who don't know business (especially now, that is directly in the hands of the former WW Vampire-in-Chief under scrutiny from a world-class videogame producer) or who treat the franchise as a pet fan project.<br /> <br /> Something has probably happened between the Chechenya backlash and now: I'd say that V5 was meant to &quot;bring all the WOD together&quot;, from old Vampire to Requiem fans, like D&amp;D 5th did. However, V20 unexpectedly became their Pathfinder, and they re-focused on making V5 more &quot;a clean slate&quot; to bring new gamers in. In doing so, they are making choices, even drastic ones.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Justin's historically a good written but he has his failings for example he's quite dismissive of the bits if wod he personally doesn't like in a way I'd be comfortable using negative terms to describe. His recent outputs strong drop in quality with sabbat and the outline for w5 and reckoning does not fill me with confidence.<br /> <br /> Personally I don't really like either Martin or his writters fluff at all, a lot of it is outright bad. I feel comfortable saying such even if I can compliment new mechanics. <br /> <br /> Possibly but I can only really observe what is shown, they're deliberately declining to produce a desired commercial products, the reasons they've given are odd or borderline absurd. This sort of behavior is ultimatly very very silly for a business to engage in.<br /> <br /> I always got the impression pathfinder was a backlash to 4th Ed and was something of embarissment for wotc","signature":"","edited"